图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Cut large agent tool output by what it means, not by where it was cut. 13 content-aware reducers + DeepSeek Harness plugin.","id":"gh:1337113106","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"toolshrink","slug":"unclecode/toolshrink","topics":["ai-agents","claude-code","context-engineering","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh-plugin","llm"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Cut large agent tool output by what it means, not by where it was cut. 13 content-aware reducers + D"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"eepSeek Harness plugin."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# toolshrink"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Cut large agent tool output by what it means, not by where it was cut.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"I use Claude Code every day, and I always wanted to intervene in how it manages\ncontext. In the earl"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"y days you could edit the session JSONL directly. Then that\ndoor closed."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"When DeepSeek open-sourced Harness, where everything is a plugin, I looked\ninside. Tool output there"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" is cut by size: keep the head, keep the tail, drop\nthe middle. I read Codex and pi, and they do the"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" same. None of them look at\nwhat the text contains."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"That fails in a predictable way. Your test suite prints 5,000 passing lines and\n3 failures in the mi"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ddle. A size cut keeps the passes and throws away the\nfailures. The model reads it, believes the run"},{"id":"p6s3","text":", and answers wrong."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"So I built the shrinker I always wished Claude Code had. It reads the output\nfirst, recognizes its s"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"hape, and keeps the part that carries the information:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Everything removed is counted in a marker the model can read, and the complete\noriginal is saved to "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"disk with a locator. Nothing is lost silently."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## The cuts"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Each cut recognizes one shape of text. The first one that recognizes the input\nruns. When none does,"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" the size fallback runs, so the result always fits the\nbudget."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Cut | Recognizes | Keeps | Drops |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `diff` | git diff, patches | changed lines, file and hunk headers, 1 context line each side | unch"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"anged context |\n| `json` | one JSON value | the structure, 3 samples per long array, 5 keys per wide"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" object, counts | repeated records |\n| `tests` | vitest, jest, pytest, cargo test, go test | failure"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"s with their explanation, the summary | passing tests |\n| `build` | tsc, cargo, gcc, webpack, esbuil"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"d | errors and warnings with their code frame, the summary | build progress |\n| `stacktrace` | node,"},{"id":"p13s6","text":" Python, Java, Ruby traces | the message and frames in YOUR code | dependency frames, counted |\n| `l"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"og` | timestamped logs | errors and warnings with the lines before them, the ending | routine lines "},{"id":"p13s8","text":"|\n| `tree` | find, ls -R, file listings | the structure, 8 entries per directory, counts | crowded d"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"irectories |\n| `repeat` | retry storms, progress spam | 2 samples per run plus \"2,998 similar lines "},{"id":"p13s10","text":"omitted\" | consecutive near-identical lines |\n| `lint` | eslint, ruff, clippy | each rule with its c"},{"id":"p13s11","text":"ount and example locations, worst files | repeated occurrences of the same rule |\n| `install` | npm,"},{"id":"p13s12","text":" pip, pnpm, cargo | the summary, versions, deprecations, vulnerabilities, errors | fetch and downloa"},{"id":"p13s13","text":"d progress |\n| `csv` | CSV, TSV, pipe tables | header, 5 rows from the start, 2 from the end, row an"},{"id":"p13s14","text":"d column counts | the rows between |\n| `gitlog` | git log, both formats | the 15 newest commits, the"},{"id":"p13s15","text":" total, the authors with counts | older commits |\n| `size` | everything (fallback) | bash: the end ·"},{"id":"p13s16","text":" grep/read: the start · unknown: both ends | the rest, counted |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Thirteen cuts ship today. Each one is a plain file with a shared interface, so\nadding your own is on"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"today. Each one is a plain file with a shared interface, so\nadding your own is one file, not a fork."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Every cut follows four rules, taken from the three agents I read:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- never return a partial line (from pi)\n- never split a UTF-16 surrogate pair (from DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p16s2","text":")\n- say exactly how much was removed: `... 15,903 characters, 401 lines omitted ...` (from Codex)\n[该"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"y exactly how much was removed: `... 15,903 characters, 401 lines omitted ...` (from Codex)\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Use it with DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"One command:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"That is the whole install. The package carries a `dsh.bundle` manifest, so\nthe plugin mounts with a "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"50,000-character default budget on the next start.\nChange the budget from your own layer, `~/.dsh/co"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" default budget on the next start.\nChange the budget from your own layer, `~/.dsh/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Hacking on it instead? Clone, `npm install && npm run build`, and mount the\nadapter file by path wit"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"h an insert row (see Adapter config below)."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Adapter config"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The log line format: `bash  64151 -> 2942 via tree+size`."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Use it as a library"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The `hint` (second argument) is optional and improves routing: `tool` picks the\nsize direction, `com"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"mand` helps detect test runs and diffs, `path` helps detect\nJSON and logs."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Write your own cut"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"A cut is one file that default-exports three members. The file name is the cut\nname."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Use it:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Or control the built-ins: `{ only: ['tests', 'diff'] }` restricts and orders,\n`{ disable: ['json'] }"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ol the built-ins: `{ only: ['tests', 'diff'] }` restricts and orders,\n`{ disable: ['json'] }` skips."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Spill: nothing is lost"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"With a spill store, the complete original is saved before any cut, and the cut\ntext ends with:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"`store.load('spill:bash-d63d2aebb643')` returns the original, byte for byte.\nFiles are cleaned after"},{"id":"p38s2","text":" 24 hours. The store is an interface; the default writes\nfiles, a host can plug its own storage."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## What I saw in live use"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"With a 3,000-character budget, the agent got a 60,000-character `find` result\ncut down to its head. "},{"id":"p40s2","text":"Its reply began: *\"The output was truncated. Let me get a\ncount by directory\"* - it saw the omission"},{"id":"p40s3","text":" marker, re-queried with aggregation,\nand answered correctly from 4,000 total characters instead of "},{"id":"p40s4","text":", re-queried with aggregation,\nand answered correctly from 4,000 total characters instead of 60,000."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"That is the design working: an honest marker turns a cut from silent data loss\ninto a signal the mod"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"el acts on. This is the intervention I always wanted, and\nnow it is a YAML row."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## TODO: cuts I want next"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Each of these is one file with the same interface. Pick one and send a pull\nrequest."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| Cut | Recognizes | Would keep |"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"| `semantic` | anything, given the agent's current goal | the chunks most relevant to the goal. Two "},{"id":"p45s2","text":"stages: lexical scoring (BM25, no model needed), then optional embedding scoring for meaning beyond "},{"id":"p45s3","text":"shared words |\n| `sql` | query results, EXPLAIN plans | the plan's expensive nodes, sampled result r"},{"id":"p45s4","text":"\n| `sql` | query results, EXPLAIN plans | the plan's expensive nodes, sampled result rows |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
